<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Allow Warlock to do super jump</Major>
    <Description>This is to allow warlock to do super jump with just 1 click. You will need to be a fire warlock to use it and you need to select under fire as your mega power to be able to use this correctly. This requires a height difference so would recommand you stand on somewhere higher and get close to the edge. Then enjoy your fly across the map!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 32 1
Delay 50
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 400 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 50
RightUp 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 50
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 25 1
Delay 50
KeyUp 25 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 50
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 50</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Destiny 2</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>